Method: 
Median of the same calendar month across complete history; P25-P75 range (min-max under four observations), trailing three complete
months when that calendar month has no history.
Basis: 
History 2024-07-01 to 2026-01-01 (exclusive) · 18 complete months · 24 purchase orders · as of 2026-01-04.
Bucket sources: 
